Bundles a pinned dependency on NimContracts (github.com/lbartoletti/NimContracts,
branch fix/generic-proc-support), MIT-licensed.

Bundles an optional pinned dependency on nimsimd
(github.com/lbartoletti/nimsimd, branch neon-avx512), MIT-licensed. It is an
opt-in SIMD backend for the limb-array bitwise ops, enabled with `-d:simd` and
out of the default build.

Depends on UniAccurate (github.com/lituus-lab/UniAccurate), Apache-2.0.